
"smart_sources:2023-01-13 - The Evil in this World_ A Native American Perspective of Evil.md": {"path":"2023-01-13 - The Evil in this World_ A Native American Perspective of Evil.md","last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"last_read":{"hash":"1e8w8oc","at":1785795029037},"class_name":"SmartSource","last_import":{"mtime":1785778700388,"size":6660,"at":1785795029063,"hash":"1e8w8oc"},"blocks":{"#---frontmatter---":[1,9],"#":[10,66]},"outlinks":[{"title":"Becky Tallent","target":"Becky Tallent","line":5},{"title":"Commentary","target":"https://favs.news/commentary/","line":14},{"title":"Commentary","target":"https://favs.news/commentary/","line":18},{"title":"Commentary","target":"https://favs.news/commentary/","line":22},{"title":"The Evil in this World","target":"https://favs.news/?s=the+evil+in+this+world","line":30},{"title":"evil in this world FAVS series","target":"https://favs.news/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/evil_logo.jpg","line":34,"embedded":true},{"title":"The Banshees of Inisherin","target":"https://www.imdb.com/title/tt11813216/","line":52},{"title":"Coffee Talk discussion on “The Evil in the World","target":"https://favs.news/spokanefavs-hosts-first-coffee-talk-of-2023-on-the-topic-the-evil-in-this-world/","line":66}],"metadata":{"title":"The Evil in this World: A Native American Perspective of Evil","source":"https://favs.news/the-evil-in-this-world-a-native-american-perspective-of-evil/?mc_cid=8598080f2d&mc_eid=3d9119f76a","author":["[[Becky Tallent]]"],"published":"2023-01-13","created":"2026-08-03","description":"Most Native Americans will say both good and evil exist, but Indigenous concepts differ from Eurocentric ideas when it comes to evil. As I have said before, there are hundreds of Indigenous tribes, and each has their own cultures and religions. As a rule, however, most seem to believe in evil – not as a concept or an entity separate from humans, but as an action made by humans."},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},